project's own work, GPL-3.0 with the project. The pages use system fonts only.

DEVELOPMENT TOOLS (not shipped)
-------------------------------
Playwright (Apache-2.0) drives Helium in tests/e2e.mjs. uv (MIT/Apache-2.0)
creates SearXNG's Python environment. mkcert (BSD-3-Clause) and Docker run
the optional local services.
